:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Ken (Enemy)]].''
'''Ken''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] gains increased health, damage, Slow Immunity and the Weaken ability.

{{Cat Info
