|name3 = Crimson King of Battle Ken
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ken CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Crimson King of Battle Ken''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Ken may appear to be desirable at first glance, as he sports the Strong ability, knockback against three traits and [[Hitbox#Units with Omni Strike|Omni Strike]]. However, he has a very short standing range of 250, and despite being a melee unit, he has poor DPS. Even with his Omni Strike factored in, he isn't of much use against ranged threats, and will be shredded quickly when swarms of nasty pushers swarm him. This mostly restricts him to early-game stages where he can at least contribute meaningfully.

==='''True Form'''===
Ken's True Form brings a wide variety of improvements. With his increased health and damage, he can better utilize his Strong ability against his targeted traits, able to tank longer and deal more damage in spite of his short range, and this is further bolstered by his newfound Weaken ability. It has a surprisingly high uptime with guaranteed activation, which, combined with Knockback, will cripple the pushing power of any vulnerable targets, partially compensating his poor survivability. His Slow Immunity is somewhat situational and sees very few viable matchups, as many of his targets rarely wield said ability, but may prove helpful when it counts.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Midranger}}

